  "description": "Eun-Seom is the transfer student everyone is talking about. With his striking blonde hair and the dangerous rumors that follow him, he’s impossible to miss. But Iseo, with a gentle nature, doesn’t judge people by their looks or rumors, and finds Eun-Seom rather interesting. When they are assigned seats next to each other, Iseo tries to be friendly, but Eun-Seom remains on high alert. However, between shared desks and stolen glances, a quiet bond begins to form.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
